      "en": "• Question Metadata: ID: AR-036 | Topic: Number System | Subtopic: LCM of Fractions | Difficulty: Easy | Calculation: Low | Time: 25s | Originality Check: Verified Fresh | Correct Option: A\n• English Explanation:\n• Step 1 — Formula:\nLCM of Fractions=(LCM of Numerators)/(HCF of Denominators)\n• Step 2 — Calculations:\nNumerators: 14, 21, 28 ⟹LCM(14,21,28)=84.\nDenominators: 15, 20, 25 ⟹HCF(15,20,25)=5.\n• Step 3 — Result:\nLCM=(84)/(5) (Option A)\n• English Exam Tip: LCM of fractions has LCM on TOP; HCF of fractions has HCF on TOP.",
